OL,3,GNEWSAWater 'deliberately' drained from
OL,4,Apart of canal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity has been working to raise
OL,7,Fwater levels along a stretch of canal
OL,8,Fin Leicestershire after reserves are
OL,9,Fthought to have been drained
OL,10,Fdeliberately.
OL,12,FWater levels dropped in a matter of
OL,13,Fhours last weekend along the Grand
OL,14,FUnion Canal, off Welford Road, near
OL,15,FKilby Lock.
OL,17,FThe Canal and River Trust believes it
OL,18,Fwas a "deliberate act" in which the
OL,19,Fpaddles, also known as sluices, within
OL,20,FKilby Lock were opened, "draining the
OL,21,Fwater out of this section of the
OL,22,Fcanal".
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
