OL,3,GNEWSAWater 'deliberately' drained from
OL,4,Apart of canal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson added: "Boat movements
OL,7,Fare still restricted in that area due
OL,8,Fto the drought, so there would have
OL,9,Fbeen no legitimate reason for anyone to
OL,10,Fopen the paddles."
